### GET PaymentInfo with ID
GET http://localhost:8080/paymentinfo?id=9

### GET all PaymentInfo records for User
GET http://localhost:8080/paymentinfo/user?userId=1

### POST new PaymentInfo
POST http://localhost:8080/paymentinfo/new
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "accountNumber": "1234567890",
  "cardNumber": "1234567890",
  "cvv": "000",
  "expiryDate": "09/50",
  "method": "credit",
  "isDefault": false
}

### PUT an updated PaymentInfo record
PUT http://localhost:8080/paymentinfo/edit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "isDefault": true
}

### PUT an update for an invalid PaymentInfo record
PUT http://localhost:8080/paymentinfo/edit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "expiryDate": "09/50"
}

### DELETE an existing PaymentInfo record
DELETE http://localhost:8080/paymentinfo/delete?id=1

### DELETE a non-existing PaymentInfo record
DELETE http://localhost:8080/paymentinfo/delete?id=999
